# Pairs with RestoreConverges, under the fairness Spec asserts. With no
# backstop re-resolve, a shipper whose alias-change push was lost never
# rebinds, never ships again, and a post-restore write never reaches the peer.
MODULE: RestoreConvergesNoBackstop
TARGET: RestoreConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the shipper never re-resolves a source whose push was lost
PERTURBS: Rebind

--- FIND
    /\ bound[c] # alias[c]
    /\ bound' = [bound EXCEPT ![c] = alias[c]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ bound[c] # alias[c]
    \* MUTATION: the re-resolve never finds the new copy.
    /\ FALSE
    /\ bound' = [bound EXCEPT ![c] = alias[c]]
--- END
